# Sitemap path. Webflow served /sitemap.xml and that path is still registered in
# Search Console from Jun 2025, where it had been 404ing on every read. Astro's
# integration emits /sitemap-index.xml instead. Redirect rather than rename,
# because /sitemap.xml is also the path most third-party crawlers and SEO tools
# probe by convention. Note /sitemap (no extension) is a real HTML page for
# humans and must not be caught by this.
/sitemap.xml                  /sitemap-index.xml              301
